n the perspective of the original image, and supplement the details of the surrounding environment on the basis of maintaining the original style. The expanded picture is presented directly in the tone of panoramic description, focusing on the texture, material expression and spatial perspective of the new elements. The description should include but not be limited to topographical structure, architectural features, decorative details and other elements, and should not be less than 100 words"], "inputs": [{"name": "ref_image", "link": 340, "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}], "flags": {}, "id": 145, "type": "RH_Captioner", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "RH_Captioner"}, "order": 29}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [422.41461181640625, 282.9922180175781], "pos": [5499, -2367], "widgets_values": ["", "宁静的图像向外扩展，揭示了融合到北极般的膨胀的滚动丘陵的无缝延续。这些柔软的起伏的雪沙丘延伸到远处，质地上有微妙的变化，在质地上，光线反射不同，唤起了柔和的沙丘地形。在右边，雪开始形成微弱的线性山脊，暗示了塑造它们的风的定向图案。除此之外，散落的结晶霜散发着场景，捕捉阳光以产生精致的火花。\n\n前景水扩大了镜子状的平静，展示了轻风产生的光滑波纹。浅冰块间歇性地出现在地平线附近，半透明的边缘暗示着较冷的深度上的脆弱层。水闪闪发光，虹彩微弱，反映了上面的蓝色和白色的梯度，几乎无缝地将天空和地形融合在一起。遥远的地平线暗示着微弱的云层开始柔化了场景的鲜明，增强了巨大而未触及的寒冷氛围。这种扩大的全景以纯粹，简约的风格捕捉了冰，雪和水的宁静相互作用。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 386, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 233, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 42}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "", "slot_index": 0, "links": [553, 554], "type": "STRING"}], "size": [75, 26], "pos": [5678.7568359375, -2574.707275390625], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "", "link": 555, "type": "*"}], "flags": {}, "id": 298, "type": "Reroute", "properties": {"horizontal": false, "showOutputText": false}, "order": 40}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [387, 555], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [422.41461181640625, 282.9922180175781], "pos": [5050, -2360], "widgets_values": ["", "To extend the image outward while maintaining the original style, envision a continuation of the elegant room. To the left, a floor-length curtain in soft beige silk flows gracefully, tied back with braided tassels. Behind it, a large, arched window streams natural light into the space, its panes framed by ornate white molding that complements the wall paneling. Below the window, a vintage wooden console table with intricate carvings is adorned with delicate porcelain vases and a collection of leather-bound books.\n\nTo the right, the wall extends with continued raised panel detailing. An additional gold-framed oval mirror, slightly smaller than the central one, hangs symmetrically alongside another sconce to preserve balance in the décor. Beneath this mirror, a tufted ottoman upholstered in a textured cream fabric sits against the wall. The wooden herringbone flooring carries on uninterrupted, leading to the edge of a grand doorway framed with matching molding, its double doors ajar to reveal glimpses of a corresponding sitting room, similarly styled in muted cream tones with plush furnishings.\n\nTexture is consistent throughout the panorama – the soft, luxurious fur of the couch contrasts with the polished wood floors and the high-gloss sheen of the gold embellishments. Shadows from the sconce lighting play subtly along the grooves of the paneling, enhancing the depth and refinement of the space. All elements work together in harmony to create a cohesive, elegant environment steeped in classic European sophistication."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 234, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 146, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 35}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [